Non-PO Invoice Phase 2 

 

 

Introduction 

This document outlines the expected sample input and output formats for phase -2 of NON PO invoice coding that contains: 

Non PO invoice GL category with explanation 

Non-PO Invoice Similar Line Description Classification 

Non PO invoice GL category with explanation 

Overview 

This section outlines the expected sample input and output formats for the Non PO invoice use case pipeline. The pipeline is designed to automate the process for identifying the suitable GL category(s) based on the invoice description and short description of each GL category. The pipeline expects one invoice in the request, processes it and generates the output.  

