Key Fields: 

invoiceID: Unique identifier for the invoice. 

invoiceDate: Date of the invoice (YYYY-MM-DD). 

approverName: Approver assigned to the invoice 

vendorID: Unique identifier for the vendor 

masterGLCategories : Exhaustive list of all GL categories that are present in the master data along with their explanation 

glCategory: GL category from the master data 

glCategoryExplanation: Short description to explain what type of expense goes into that GL category 

invoiceLineItems: List of items on the invoice, each with: 

invoiceLineID: Unique identifier for each line description 

lineDescription: Description of the invoice line 

 

